			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — build config, resource bundle, and stale artifact cleanup\n\nAdvance the Element submodule pointer to c3abe5ad, integrating build-system and housekeeping changes across three components.\n\nCocoon: Rebuild Target/ JS bundles and source maps after RouteManifest regeneration. No new RPC methods — Mountain method count remains at 140. Ensures bootstrap, service, handler, and gRPC artifacts are consistent with the current RouteManifest.\n\nMountain: Encode the full build configuration string in the binary, library, package, and product name for unambiguous artifact provenance in debugging and CI. Add the missing Sky Target resource entries (Browser, BrowserProxy, Bundled, Electron, Favicon, Isolation, Manifest.json, Mountain) to tauri.conf.json so Tauri bundles the complete Sky build output — previously the app bundle could ship without all editor UI resources, causing runtime load failures. Update the app identifier to the expanded canonical form matching the product name.\n\nWind: Delete stale generated TypeScript artifacts under Source/Effect/ — CommandCatalog, ServiceCatalog, all IAsteriskUpstream service interface definitions, and 16 bridge shape implementations that were superseded by the previous daily regeneration cycle. Removes only generated files with no hand-authored code.",
